{"title": "Mage Armour", "pageid": 2256, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mage_Armour", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Abjuration spells", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mage_Armour.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Mage_Armour.webp/300px-Mage_Armour.webp, /w/images/5/51/Mage_Armour.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Mage_Armour.webp/300px-Mage_Armour.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Mage_Armour.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Mage Armour </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 abjuration spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to surround an unarmoured creature (including themselves, if unarmoured) with magical protection.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Surround an unarmoured creature in a protective magical force. Its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> increases to 13 + its <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity#Dexterity_modifier_chart\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a>. \n</p><p>This effect does not stack with <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence\">Unarmoured Defence</a>.\n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">The target can't be wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></span>.</span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_MageArmor</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MageArmor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MageArmor\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Mage_Armour\"> Condition: Mage Armour </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\">Mage Armour</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Base <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> is 13.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\">Magic Initiate: Sorcerer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\">Magic Initiate: Wizard</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\">Moon Devotion Robe</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Also granted to <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlocks</a> who choose the <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Invocation\" title=\"Eldritch Invocation\">Eldritch Invocation</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Shadows\" title=\"Armour of Shadows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/40px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour of Shadows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Shadows\" title=\"Armour of Shadows\">Armour of Shadows</a> at level 2+. This version of the spell only targets the caster, and does not expend a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slots\" title=\"Spells\">Spell Slot</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a>  can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour\" title=\"Scroll of Mage Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour\" title=\"Scroll of Mage Armour\">Scroll of Mage Armour</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This buff persists if the caster is removed from the active party, even if rejoining later.\n<ul><li>If cast by a <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard</a>, this spell must remain <a href=\"/wiki/Prepared_spells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prepared spells\">prepared</a> by the party member who cast it; removing Mage Armour from the caster's Prepared Spells list immediately removes the buff from all party members whom the caster applied it to. If applied by using a <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour\" title=\"Scroll of Mage Armour\">scroll</a> directly, instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribing</a> it into a wizard's spellbook, then the caster need not keep the spell prepared to maintain the buff.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If a party member who has Mage Armour equips a piece of Armour, the buff is removed. Mage Armour is not reapplied when unequipping that Armour; it must to be cast on them once more.</li>\n<li>The normal base <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> is 10 + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a>; this spell changes it to 13 + Dexterity modifier.\n<ul><li>The recipient still get bonuses from other sources that do not change their base armour class, such as +1 AC <a href=\"/wiki/Robes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Robes\">robes</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bracers_of_Defence\" title=\"Bracers of Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bracers_of_Defence\" title=\"Bracers of Defence\">Bracers of Defence</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Faith_(Condition)\" title=\"Shield of Faith (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield of Faith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Faith_(Condition)\" title=\"Shield of Faith (Condition)\">Shield of Faith</a>, etc.</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a> marked as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" title=\"Light Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/30px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Armour\">Light</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/30px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour\" title=\"Heavy Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavy Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heavy Armour\">Heavy Armour</a> count as armour, and prevent Mage Armour from working.</li>\n<li>Mage Armour works while a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" title=\"Shields\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/20px-Shields_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/30px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/40px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/20px-Shields_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shields_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">Shield</a> is equipped.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\">Mage Armour</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Resilience\" title=\"Draconic Resilience\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/20px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/30px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/40px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Resilience\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/20px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Resilience\" title=\"Draconic Resilience\">Draconic Resilience</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Barbarian)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Barbarian)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\">Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\">Unarmoured Defence (Monk)</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\">Barkskin</a> all change base armour class and therefore do not stack.\n<ul><li>If the recipient has multiples of these they only get the benefit which provides the best <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Mage Armour works in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a> as long as the user has no armour equipped before transforming.\n<ul><li>This effect only works on forms with a base <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> of less than 13.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Mage Armour does not count as wearing armour for things like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Unarmoured Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Unarmoured Movement\">Unarmoured Movement</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Become_the_Bulwark\" title=\"Become the Bulwark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Become the Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Become_the_Bulwark\" title=\"Become the Bulwark\">Become the Bulwark</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/20px-Defence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/30px-Defence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/40px-Defence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/20px-Defence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\">Defence</a>.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Mage Armour is <b>Mactē Virtutē</b>, Latin for <i>\"With great virtue\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mage_armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.p